1
00:00:00,631 --> 00:00:02,211
(Leonard:)I can't believe you kept this.

2
00:00:02,424 --> 00:00:04,804
(Penny:)I was gonna throw it away,
but I just couldn't.

3
00:00:05,969 --> 00:00:07,389
(Leonard:)That is so sweet.

4
00:00:07,638 --> 00:00:09,018
Heh.

5
00:00:12,226 --> 00:00:16,146
(Leonard:)In 25 to 30 minutes I'm gonna show you
how much this means to me.

6
00:00:27,908 --> 00:00:30,498
- Leonard?
- Yeah, hi.

7
00:00:32,162 --> 00:00:33,492
(Leonard:)How's it going?

8
00:00:34,581 --> 00:00:37,001
(Sheldon:)Can't complain, thanks for asking.

9
00:00:39,086 --> 00:00:41,466
(Sheldon:)What were you doing out
at 3:00 in the morning?

10
00:00:42,047 --> 00:00:45,257
Well... What are you doing up?

11
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:47,840
(Sheldon:)I was using the bathroom.

12
00:00:48,846 --> 00:00:51,686
(Leonard:)Yeah, well, so was I.

13
00:00:59,106 --> 00:01:01,066
(Leonard:)Obviously.

